@100 = ~Lucky Ring
A young woman named Felicity has lost her lucky ring somewhere within the River District. I should hand it over if I find it.~
@101 = ~Lucky Ring
I found Felicity's gold-leaf ring in Hannibal's Hideout and returned it to her in the River District.~
@102 = ~I have lost my lucky ring somewhere in this area. If you'd be so kind as to help me find it, I'd be truly grateful.~
@103 = ~I found this ring. Is it yours, Felicity?~
@104 = ~If you find my lucky ring, please bring it back to me. I would be very grateful.~
@105 = ~I believe this ring belongs to you, Felicity.~
@106 = ~You found it! My ring! I had almost given up hope. Thank you, truly. Please accept these coins as a token of my gratitude, and my best wishes for your journey.~
@107 = ~It's good to have my lucky ring back. Thank you again, my friend. May fortune favor your travels!~
